            "type": "game",
            "name": "Tomato Jones 2",
            "steam_appid": 625940,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s just a red tomato wearing a silly hat. He tries to look like a cool tomb raider, rolling and jumping across the maps. Help him find all the treasures in the mystic castle, or watch him meet a variety of painful ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tomato Jones 2</strong> is the sequel to the immensely fun predecessor, <i>Tomato Jones</i>, which is already available on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This physics-based puzzle/adventure game combines classic RPG platforming gameplay with the skill-driven style of ball-rolling games. Your goal is to collect all the coins and the hidden golden artifact at the end of each level while avoiding various dangerous traps, obstacles, and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game captures the spirit of <i>Indiana Jones</i> movies while aiming to be as funny and humorous as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/625940/extras/2c67386459db31e3fed6f87b00ea1936.avif?t=1727007266\" width=746 height=236 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEW FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 beautiful and challenging levels (10 more than its predecessor)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning &quot;soft body&quot; tomato physics and significantly improved graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many new and dangerous traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative camera movement and viewing angles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely new world map with areas to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun soundtrack and sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple funny hats to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of ketchup</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And hey.. you can still drive mine carts! 😉</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/625940/extras/438366783a3b34d4fe496f761e59c724.avif?t=1727007266\" width=746 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tomato Jones 2</i> is harder than its predecessor, and we highly recommend playing the first game, <strong><i>Tomato Jones</i></strong>, as well.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s just a red tomato wearing a silly hat. He tries to look like a cool tomb raider, rolling and jumping across the maps. Help him find all the treasures in the mystic castle, or watch him meet a variety of painful ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tomato Jones 2</strong> is the sequel to the immensely fun predecessor, <i>Tomato Jones</i>, which is already available on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This physics-based puzzle/adventure game combines classic RPG platforming gameplay with the skill-driven style of ball-rolling games. Your goal is to collect all the coins and the hidden golden artifact at the end of each level while avoiding various dangerous traps, obstacles, and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game captures the spirit of <i>Indiana Jones</i> movies while aiming to be as funny and humorous as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/625940/extras/2c67386459db31e3fed6f87b00ea1936.avif?t=1727007266\" width=746 height=236 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEW FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 beautiful and challenging levels (10 more than its predecessor)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning &quot;soft body&quot; tomato physics and significantly improved graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many new and dangerous traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative camera movement and viewing angles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely new world map with areas to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun soundtrack and sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple funny hats to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of ketchup</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And hey.. you can still drive mine carts! 😉</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/625940/extras/438366783a3b34d4fe496f761e59c724.avif?t=1727007266\" width=746 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tomato Jones 2</i> is harder than its predecessor, and we highly recommend playing the first game, <strong><i>Tomato Jones</i></strong>, as well.</p>",
            "short_description": "Tomato Jones 2 is the sequel to the fun-filled Tomato Jones, available on Steam.Join a red tomato in a silly hat as he tries to be a cool tomb raider, rolling and jumping across maps. Help him find treasures in the mystic castle, or watch him meet a variety of unfortunate fates!",
